description: Absolute import aliases for hand-written platform app code
globs: "{src/app,src/components,src/hooks,src/services,src/stores,src/models,src/validations}/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Import Alias

- Local imports use aliases declared by `tsconfig.json` (normally `@/*`).
- Do not apply to `.next/` or generated shadcn files.
- No new relative imports `../foo` or `./foo` in hand-written app code.
